{"2960400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Star Ronin", "steam_appid": 2960400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960400/extras/6389ecef66ec1a687ba2ca00509eef51.poster.avif?t=1786374992\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960400/extras/6389ecef66ec1a687ba2ca00509eef51.webm?t=1786374992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960400/extras/6389ecef66ec1a687ba2ca00509eef51.mp4?t=1786374992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The corporation saved your family. For a price. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now they’ve come to collect on your debt.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's only one way to pay it back - dangerous work, no questions asked. Star Ronin is a top-down ARPG where you go loud or go quiet, craft your own arsenal, and take on jobs that never play out the same way twice.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GO LOUD, OR GO QUIET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960400/extras/a47588d607239c5a1da888b92d831890.poster.avif?t=1786374992\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960400/extras/a47588d607239c5a1da888b92d831890.webm?t=1786374992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960400/extras/a47588d607239c5a1da888b92d831890.mp4?t=1786374992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak past enemies with thermoptic camouflage, or get in close and backstab them. Rush a room with your jetpack, call in drones, or just go loud with the biggest gun you've got. Realistic sightlines and intelligent enemies mean every approach has to be earned.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A VAST CATALOG OF FOES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960400/extras/ee673e907c9fb1d8e8e7a3fb9e9f8c72.poster.avif?t=1786374992\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960400/extras/ee673e907c9fb1d8e8e7a3fb9e9f8c72.webm?t=1786374992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960400/extras/ee673e907c9fb1d8e8e7a3fb9e9f8c72.mp4?t=1786374992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corporate goons are just the start. Expect swarms of kamikaze bombs, robot dogs with flamethrower heads, and bosses with vicious abilities, all reacting intelligently to how you fight, forcing you to adapt fast, or die trying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR OWN WAY OUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960400/extras/28b55c02cb88c51f87a45ea2cba44d29.poster.avif?t=1786374992\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960400/extras/28b55c02cb88c51f87a45ea2cba44d29.webm?t=1786374992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960400/extras/28b55c02cb88c51f87a45ea2cba44d29.mp4?t=1786374992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy gear on the open market, or craft your own weapons, exo-suits, and upgrades. Build a tank, chase speed, or set up a power pool for energy hungry weapons. Your call, your build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO TWO JOBS ARE THE SAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960400/extras/a4508fe67b0289f732b8b2c5132dc0df.poster.avif?t=1786374992\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960400/extras/a4508fe67b0289f732b8b2c5132dc0df.webm?t=1786374992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960400/extras/a4508fe67b0289f732b8b2c5132dc0df.mp4?t=1786374992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission and map is procedurally generated, from objectives to enemies, traps, and boss encounters, across environments from corporate offices to desert moons. Everything can be blown up, set on fire, or used against them. One job pays well. The next might kill you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PICK YOUR DIFFICULTY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960400/extras/f082c019380c62871e67c1d2dba5683d.poster.avif?t=1786374992\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960400/extras/f082c019380c62871e67c1d2dba5683d.webm?t=1786374992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960400/extras/f082c019380c62871e67c1d2dba5683d.mp4?t=1786374992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on the story, or test yourself against a true difficulty curve built to keep you engaged for days. Use the built in tutorial and Arena mode to master your build before risking it for real.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A debt to be paid.</strong>  Survive under the Charter that keeps the megacorps from wiping each other out, and pay off a family debt with dangerous, corporate-sanctioned wet-work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go loud, or go quiet. </strong>Thermoptic camouflage, jetpack traversal, and drone support give you a different way into every job, whether that's a clean backstab or a full assault.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated missions &amp; destructible environments. </strong>Objectives, maps, enemies, traps, and boss encounters change on every run, in environments that can be blown up, set on fire, or used creatively.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A vast catalog of foes</strong>. Kamikaze bomb swarms, robot dogs with flamethrower heads, and bosses with vicious abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intelligent enemies.</strong> Foes react to your tactics, forcing you to think on your feet and adjust your approach mid-fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep crafting system. </strong>Build and upgrade your own weapons, exo-suits, and equipment. Tank, speed, or power pool builds, your choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A difficulty curve built to last. </strong>Multiple difficulty levels take you from story focused runs to a true test of roguelike skill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena mode.</strong> Test out new builds and master your mechanics without risking your family's fate on a live job.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic lighting system</strong>. A sophisticated, realistic 2D lighting engine, with flashlights and night vision for navigating the dark.</p></li></ul>", "about_t