 </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A debt to be paid.</strong>  Survive under the Charter that keeps the megacorps from wiping each other out, and pay off a family debt with dangerous, corporate-sanctioned wet-work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go loud, or go quiet. </strong>Thermoptic camouflage, jetpack traversal, and drone support give you a different way into every job, whether that's a clean backstab or a full assault.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated missions &amp; destructible environments. </strong>Objectives, maps, enemies, traps, and boss encounters change on every run, in environments that can be blown up, set on fire, or used creatively.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A vast catalog of foes</strong>. Kamikaze bomb swarms, robot dogs with flamethrower heads, and bosses with vicious abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intelligent enemies.</strong> Foes react to your tactics, forcing you to think on your feet and adjust your approach mid-fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep crafting system. </strong>Build and upgrade your own weapons, exo-suits, and equipment. Tank, speed, or power pool builds, your choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A difficulty curve built to last. </strong>Multiple difficulty levels take you from story focused runs to a true test of roguelike skill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena mode.</strong> Test out new builds and master your mechanics without risking your family's fate on a live job.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic lighting system</strong>. A sophisticated, realistic 2D lighting engine, with flashlights and night vision for navigating the dark.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Megacorps run the world and they’ve come to collect on your debt. To pay it back, you’ll need to take on the most dangerous jobs possible. In this cyberpunk ARPG set in a dystopian future, you’re going to need a lot of weapons and even more skills to survive and finish the job.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960400/b53c800ec8b92c938ca2871cedad692ed577beee/header.jpg?t=1786374992", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960400/fcf9657f3315b24f72d842b0a65a089df3998fbf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786374992", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960400/fcf9657f3315b24f72d842b0a65a089df3998fbf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786374992", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3+ GHz CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 1060 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3+ GHz CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 1060 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "© Wolfe Games - All Rights Reserved", "developers": ["Wolfe Games"], "publishers": ["Wolfe Games"], "demos": [{"appid": 3320820, "description